Let me start implementing. First, let me understand the approach:

1. spawn_context_prompt needs an optional worktree_path parameter to tell the sub-agent about its working directory
2. handle_spawn needs to create a worktree, pass the path to the sub-agent context, and the sub-agent should cd into the worktree
3. The worktree path needs to be tracked in SpawnTask so cleanup can happen
4. Cleanup happens after completion (sync) or in the background task's completion path (bg)

